# Project Anatomy

## Project Overview
**storia-mobile** — Flutter e-reader application for language learning with audio features and parallel text display.

## Directory Structure

### Core Application (`lib/src/`)
- **audio/** — Audio engine and playback
  - `audio_engine.dart` — Main audio engine (AudioEngine class)
- **data/** — Data models and repositories
  - `pronunciation_models.dart` — Data models for pronunciations
  - `pronunciation_repository.dart` — Repository for pronunciation data access
- **features/reader/** — Main reading feature
  - `page_renderer.dart` — Main page rendering widget
  - **overlay/** — Text overlay system for word highlighting
    - `overlay_frame.dart` — Frame containing overlay words
    - `overlay_layout_engine.dart` — Layout calculation for overlays
    - `overlay_text_element.dart` — Individual word/element in overlay
  - **runtime/** — Runtime state management
    - **providers/** — Riverpod providers
      - `word_tts_provider.dart` — Provider for word-level TTS functionality
    - **services/** — Business logic services
      - `pronunciation_playback_service.dart` — Service for pronunciation playback
  - `pronunciation_highlight.dart` — NEW: Highlight state model

## Key Models
- `WordPronunciation` — Pronunciation data with audio URLs and segments
- `BookPronunciationManifest` — Map of word → pronunciation data
- `PronunciationHighlightPart` — NEW: Individual syllable highlight state
- `PronunciationHighlightState` — NEW: Overall highlight state for a word

## Key Providers/Services
- `WordTtsNotifier` — Notifier managing TTS state (tappedWordIndex, highlightParts, activeHighlightPartIndex)
- `PronunciationPlaybackService` — Service handling audio playback coordination
- `PronunciationRepository` — Repository (abstract) for fetching pronunciation manifests

## Test Files
- `test/features/reader/runtime/pronunciation_playback_service_test.dart` — Tests for PronunciationPlaybackService
- `test/features/reader/overlay/overlay_pronunciation_highlight_test.dart` — Tests for overlay highlights
- `test/features/reader/runtime/word_tts_provider_test.dart` — Tests for WordTtsNotifier

## Dependencies
- `riverpod`/`flutter_riverpod` — State management
- `audio_session` — Audio session management  
- `just_audio` — Audio playback

## Architecture Pattern
Riverpod-based state management with:
- Notifiers for UI state
- Services for business logic
- Repository pattern for data access

## Active Branch
`cue` — Word pronunciation tap-to-highlight feature

